{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20201","headline":"吊比干墓 · 孟郊","name":"吊比干墓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"殷辛帝天下，厌爲天下尊。\n乾刚既一断，贤愚无二门。\n佞是福身本，忠是丧己源。\n饿虎不食子，人无骨肉恩。\n日影不入地，下埋冤死魂。\n有骨不爲土，应作直木根。\n今来过此乡，下马吊此坟。\n静念君臣间，有道谁敢论。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20201.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20201","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}